@Server_HostAddress = http://localhost:5398

### Log in as the development administrator and copy the token from the response
POST {{Server_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@raceday.local",
  "password": "Admin#12345"
}

### Paste the token here
@token = <paste-access-token>

### List public events
GET {{Server_HostAddress}}/api/events?page=1&pageSize=20
Accept: application/json

### List venues
GET {{Server_HostAddress}}/api/venues

### Create a draft event (multipart form)
POST {{Server_HostAddress}}/api/events
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=raceday

--raceday
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="Title"

City 10K
--raceday
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="Description"

Annual city race
--raceday
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="EventDate"

2027-03-01T08:00:00
--raceday
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="VenueId"

1
--raceday--

### Add a category to event 1
POST {{Server_HostAddress}}/api/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "10 km", "entryFee": 150, "eventId": 1, "distanceKm": 10, "maxParticipants": 200 }

### Publish event 1
POST {{Server_HostAddress}}/api/events/1/publish
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Register the logged-in user for category 1
POST {{Server_HostAddress}}/api/registrations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "categoryId": 1 }

### Leaderboard for category 1
GET {{Server_HostAddress}}/api/results/leaderboard/1
